# which means Herdr has gained a theme since this table was copied. Its colours
# are unknowable from here: the palette never crosses the socket API, and there
# is no theme event to subscribe to (verified against the 0.8.2 API schema —
# no theme, palette, colour, or appearance surface anywhere in it).
#
# The terminal palette is the least-wrong answer available. It keeps the
# semantics right (green idle, yellow working, red blocked) and follows the host
# terminal profile, so the row still reads correctly even though it cannot be
# guaranteed to match the sidebar. Refresh PALETTES from src/app/state.rs when
# this fires.
